{"3447740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Terminal Mass", "steam_appid": 3447740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique blend of fps action and survival thriller in a dystopian, analogue horror-scape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An oppressive atmosphere of isolation in a treacherous environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions to earn new upgrades and unlock deeper sectors of the Domain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track down the three mechanical horrors to undo the Domain</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/786d0eb89b9775954bb0834c65a9985f.poster.avif?t=1778845855\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/786d0eb89b9775954bb0834c65a9985f.webm?t=1778845855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/786d0eb89b9775954bb0834c65a9985f.mp4?t=1778845855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MISSIONS &amp; COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions to progress through the game</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy structures to shift the Domain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt down Monsters to cull their population</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover Blueprints to unlock new weapons</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/456307191e4f45fe38565ad8f10c3e66.poster.avif?t=1778845855\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/456307191e4f45fe38565ad8f10c3e66.webm?t=1778845855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/456307191e4f45fe38565ad8f10c3e66.mp4?t=1778845855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADES &amp; UNLOCKS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the “HUB” after a successful run</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 16 Weapons from pistols to rifles to double sawed-off shotguns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relics to purchase during a run, giving you temporary improvements until the end of the run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/6b15d13d11ef3991381261ec2b3338d1.poster.avif?t=1778845855\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/6b15d13d11ef3991381261ec2b3338d1.webm?t=1778845855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/6b15d13d11ef3991381261ec2b3338d1.mp4?t=1778845855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MONSTERS &amp; HORRORS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through 3 distinct sectors. Defeat the mechanical horror of each sector to unlock the next. Extract their organs to undo the Domain</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Guts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Pipeworks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Belly of the Beast</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><spa