raph\" >Destroy structures to shift the Domain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt down Monsters to cull their population</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover Blueprints to unlock new weapons</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/456307191e4f45fe38565ad8f10c3e66.poster.avif?t=1778845855\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/456307191e4f45fe38565ad8f10c3e66.webm?t=1778845855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/456307191e4f45fe38565ad8f10c3e66.mp4?t=1778845855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADES &amp; UNLOCKS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the “HUB” after a successful run</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 16 Weapons from pistols to rifles to double sawed-off shotguns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relics to purchase during a run, giving you temporary improvements until the end of the run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/6b15d13d11ef3991381261ec2b3338d1.poster.avif?t=1778845855\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/6b15d13d11ef3991381261ec2b3338d1.webm?t=1778845855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/6b15d13d11ef3991381261ec2b3338d1.mp4?t=1778845855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MONSTERS &amp; HORRORS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through 3 distinct sectors. Defeat the mechanical horror of each sector to unlock the next. Extract their organs to undo the Domain</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Guts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Pipeworks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Belly of the Beast</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/1dd187732dff44e27a7ca7fa71731c76.poster.avif?t=1778845855\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/1dd187732dff44e27a7ca7fa71731c76.webm?t=1778845855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/1dd187732dff44e27a7ca7fa71731c76.mp4?t=1778845855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "The “Domain” exists as a mass of cold concrete, twisted monsters, and chaotic anomalies. You are an “Agent” sent to ensure it does not reach “Terminal Mass”. Complete missions. Upgrade your weaponry. Access deeper and darker sectors of the Domain. Will you defeat the horrors that lie at its core?", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/e750b767804491a9a6c8812435b828aa4afa9566/header.jpg?t=1778845855", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/a79299d9efa2d022e6b8e8a99ff50782d6f24e25/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778845855", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/a79299d9efa2d022e6b8e8a99ff50782d6f24e25/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778845855", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><u